== Trivia ==
* Mystery Gift is based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=839883727 this Steam Workshop item] by Striped.
* The appearance and pickup quote of the item is a reference to the game [[wikipedia:Spelunky|Spelunky]], where there is an item called "Mystery Box", with the description "Thanks! I wrapped it up nice for you!"
* The item's name is also a reference to the ''[[wikipedia:Pokémon|Pokémon]]'' franchise's feature for distributing event Pokémon.
* The item having a chance to give A Lump of Coal references Santa's tendency to gift coal to naughty children.
* The item having a chance to give The Poop references one of Isaac's floor transition's dreams, in which he is gifted poop.

